MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_001: Hah! Hyah! Haaah!
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_002: <NCA>"Is that my spear technique?"
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_003: Oh, I hope you don't think me presumptuous. I've\nbeen studying the way you wield a spear.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_004: I'm still getting a handle on the movement,\nbut eventually it'll be second nature to me.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_005: You're the strongest fighter I've ever seen. With your\ntechniques, I might be stronger too.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_006: <NCA>"Why do you seek strength?"
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_007: Hm... Guess I never thought much about it.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_008: I've always been trying to get stronger, ever since\nI was a soldier of Saramis.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_009: The more admiration and recognition I received,\nthe more I felt the need to live up to that reputation.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_010: <NCA>"You have a commendable sense of duty."
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_011: <NCB>"So that's why you want to get stronger."
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_012: <ACA>I'm honored to hear you say that, but...I don't think\nit was all for the sake of duty.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_013: <ACB>Maybe it started that way, but now? I'm not so sure.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_014: When I train lately, it sometimes feels almost selfish.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_015: Come to think about it, I didn't feel quite so intense\na need for strength until after I left my kingdom.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_016: Back then I had nothing but the sole desire to survive\non my own.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_017: I worried that if I didn't get stronger, I wouldn't last\nvery long in this world.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_018: Mm...
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_019: I kept training as I traveled around, became a\nmercenary, and fought to live every day since.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_020: So, I suppose I've come to believe that one's strength\nis at the core of their very being.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_021: I should thank you, Promised One. I think I was due\nfor a little self-reflection.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_022: My feelings and thoughts have been so scattered\nlately, but now I feel somehow...recentered.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_023: <NCA>"This is also training, just for your mind."
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_024: Exactly. Whenever I feel myself going astray,\nI'll think back on this conversation.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_A_025: And I'll keep getting stronger, for as long as I'm\nfighting by your side.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_001: Hah! Hoh! Hyah! Tyaaaah!
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_002: Haaah... Haaah... Promised One. So, you've\nreturned at last.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_003: <NCA>"Aren't you surprised to see me?"
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_004: Of course not. No one with your strength could\ndie in a place like that.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_005: I knew you'd return. That's why I'm here.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_006: I was prepared to wait years, decades even, for you\nto show up.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_007: I kept swinging my spear, training so my technique\nwouldn't get rusty while I waited.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_008: <NCA>"Thank you for waiting for me."
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_009: <NCB>"Why such powerful commitment?"
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_010: <ACA>You don't need to thank me. But there is something\nI'd like to ask of you.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_011: <ACB>I just knew I had to see you again. You're the only\none who can make this dream of mine come true.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_012: You are the strongest warrior who's ever lived.\nThere's no one else like you...anywhere.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_013: I would like you... No, I need you to make me\nyour apprentice.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_014: The battle over the fate of the world may be done,\nbut I still want to get stronger.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_015: All I can offer is my skill and dedication. Please,\nlet that be enough to travel with you.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_016: <NCA>"Heh... I couldn't say no to that."
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_017: <NCB>"I'd find your presence a comfort."
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_018: Th-then you'll let me join you?
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_019: Thank you.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_020: <RSDS>This means...everything. Strength is how I live.\nBattles are where I live.
MID_SE_Ism_Ned_S_021: So, let's keep living, Promised One—together,\nonward, one battle at a time.